**/human_adjudication*/
**/ignorance_documents/
**/paper_writting/
**/review_packets/
**/followup_*/
.claude/

# The original article PDFs and supplementary workbook are intentionally tracked.

# Recreated caches and temporary environments.
**/document_outputs/
